t Satori is the sage of the forest  for obvious nature-loving reasons or  that he's the new sage of animals or  rupees or literally anything else it  for this reason that I don't think what  sages represent is important but rather  what they do that matters the most the  Lord of the mountain was and is an  eternal protector of the wildlife upon  Satori mountain the lone sage of legend  and to be honest with you that's enough  for me but what do you guys think did  the Lord of the mountain die battling  Ganon's monsters or something else and  is he reincarnated by his blue peas to  cleanse the mountain over and over again  for all eternity or something else let  me know what you think in a comment  below also if you enjoyed the video  please be sure to like it up to get it  moving around on YouTube also also  subscribe if you haven't already with  that Bela Khan for much more juicy  Nintendo stuffs to come as always huge  thank you to my amazing patrons of which  I have two more editions welcome to  carry me land Tim and thank you so much  for choosing to support the channel if  you're interested in getting your name  up here at the end of each of my videos  feel free to check out the link in the  description below for more info also  down there are links to my social media  pages so please be sure to stop by and  say hi  that's all I've gotten this one so do me  a huge favor and have a great rest of  your day  this is Masum panda bandits signing out  peace  [Music]

